"Sources are tried in the order set under Source order. NetEase lyrics are Simplified Chinese. Apple Music lyrics need an Apple Music subscription, Musixmatch lyrics the Musixmatch app: unlocking checks for them." = "依「來源順序」依序嘗試。網易雲歌詞為簡體中文。Apple Music 歌詞需要 Apple Music 訂閱，Musixmatch 歌詞需要 Musixmatch App，解鎖時會確認。";
